<title>USA: U.S. wheat weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. wheat major net sales activity in the week ended Sept 5 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:    1996/97		   1997/98</p>
<p> South Korea  152,000		    Nil</p>
<p> Japan	   94,700</p>
<p> Poland	  50,000</p>
<p> Philippines   39,900</p>
<p> Egypt	   35,500</p>
<p>Net sales of 577,200 tonnes were one-third above the previous week and one-quarter above the four-week average.</p>
<p>Exports of 954,400 tonnes were 28 percent higher than the prior week.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Egypt, Pakistan, South Korea, Brazil and Japan.</p>
</text>
